{"Manual reduce to combine SQL fragments is error-prone - should use Prisma.sql.join for clarity and to avoid accidental parenthesis mistakes": 0.16263437271118164, "ANY with empty arrays yields false for all comparisons - need to handle edge case properly (already handled for userId but should verify for all cases)": 0.48402711749076843, "Comparing Prisma.sql objects directly in tests is brittle - two separately created Prisma.sql template literals may not be equal even with same contents. Should compare serialized SQL and parameters instead": 0.5542263984680176, "Double-quoted column names in raw SQL must match actual database column names - if Prisma mapping uses different underlying column names or database uses snake_case, queries will break": 0.3642767369747162, "Test assertions using deep equality against inline Prisma.sql template literals may fail if service constructs SQL with slightly different parenthesis arrangement even if semantically equivalent": 0.4895680844783783, "Missing explicit unit/integration test for empty team/user list cases to verify OR branch doesn't include ANY(...) for empty arrays": 0.32166337966918945}